  "notes": "{殴|なぐ}る is a transitive verb meaning to punch or strike with the fist.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pattern: [person]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{殴|なぐ}る or [body part]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{殴|なぐ}る\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{顔|かお}→顔：00558_kao⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{殴|なぐ}る: to punch in the face\n- ⟦{頭|あたま}→頭：00574_atama⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{殴|なぐ}る: to hit on the head\n- {殴|なぐ}られる: to be punched (passive)\n- ⟦{殴|なぐ}り{合|あ}う→殴り合う：noentry⟧: to fight, exchange blows\n\nRELATED 'HITTING' VERBS:\n- {殴|なぐ}る: to punch (fist, strong)\n- ⟦{叩|たた}く→叩く：02072_tataku⟧: to hit, slap (open hand, lighter)\n- ⟦{打|う}つ→打つ：01221_utsu⟧: to hit, strike (general, also for typing)\n- ⟦{蹴|け}る→蹴る：02054_keru⟧: to kick\n- ⟦{殴|なぐ}りつける→殴りつける：noentry⟧: to strike hard, punch violently\n\nLEGAL/FORMAL TERMS:\n- ⟦{暴行|ぼうこう}→暴行：27862_boukou⟧: assault\n- ⟦{暴力|ぼうりょく}→暴力：02528_bouryoku⟧: violence\n- ⟦{傷害|しょうがい}→傷害：22910_shougai⟧: bodily injury",
